&lt;hr /&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;polar-open-source-payments-infrastructure-for-the-21st-century&#34;&gt;Polar: Open Source payments infrastructure for the 21st century
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Focus on building your passion, while we focus on the infrastructure to get you paid.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell SaaS and digital products in minutes&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;All-in-one funding &amp;amp; monetization platform for developers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Sell access to GitHub repositories, Discord Support channels, File Downloads, License Keys &amp;amp; much more with Digital Products &amp;amp; Subscriptions.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;We&amp;rsquo;re the merchant of record handling the&amp;hellip;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;hellip;boilerplate (billing, receipts, customer accounts etc)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&amp;hellip;headaches (sales tax, VAT)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;pricing&#34;&gt;Pricing
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;4% + 40¢&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;No fixed monthly costs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Additional fees may apply. &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.polar.sh/documentation/polar-as-merchant-of-record/fees&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Read more&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;roadmap-issues--feature-requests&#34;&gt;Roadmap, Issues &amp;amp; Feature Requests
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🎯 Upcoming milestones.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/polarsource/polar/issues/3242&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Check out what we&amp;rsquo;re building towards&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;💬 Shape the future of Polar with us.&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://discord.gg/Pnhfz3UThd&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Join our Discord&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🐛 Found a bug?&lt;/strong&gt; &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/polarsource/polar/issues&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Submit it here&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;🔓 Found a security vulnerability?&lt;/strong&gt; We greatly appreciate responsible and private disclosures. See &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./SECURITY.md&#34; &gt;Security&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;h3 id=&#34;polar-api--sdk&#34;&gt;Polar API &amp;amp; SDK
&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;p&gt;You can integrate Polar on your docs, sites or services using our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.polar.sh/api-reference&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Public API&lt;/a&gt; and &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://docs.polar.sh/developers/webhooks&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;Webhook API&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;We also maintain SDKs for the following languages:&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;JavaScript (Node.js and browsers): &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/polarsource/polar-js&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;polarsource/polar-js&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Python: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/polarsource/polar-python&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;polarsource/polar-python&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;h2 id=&#34;contributions&#34;&gt;Contributions
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;p&gt;Our &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./DEVELOPMENT.md&#34; &gt;&lt;code&gt;DEVELOPMENT.md&lt;/code&gt;&lt;/a&gt; file contains everything you need to know to configure your development environment.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;blockquote&gt;
&lt;p&gt;[!TIP]
Want to get started quickly? Use GitHub Codespaces.&lt;/p&gt;
