&lt;h2 id=&#34;monorepo&#34;&gt;Monorepo
&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./server/README.md&#34; &gt;server&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; – Python / FastAPI / Dramatiq / SQLAlchemy (PostgreSQL) / Redis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./clients/README.md&#34; &gt;clients&lt;/a&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; – Turborepo
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./clients/apps/web&#34; &gt;web&lt;/a&gt; (Dashboard) – NextJS (TypeScript)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;./clients/packages/polarkit&#34; &gt;polarkit&lt;/a&gt; - Shared React components&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;sub&gt;♥️🙏 To our &lt;code&gt;pyproject.toml&lt;/code&gt; friends: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/tiangolo/fastapi&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
    &gt;FastAPI&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/pydantic/pydantic&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
