    &gt;Sentry&lt;/a&gt; + more&lt;/sub&gt;&lt;br /&gt;
&lt;sub&gt;♥️🙏 To our &lt;code&gt;package.json&lt;/code&gt; friends: &lt;a class=&#34;link&#34; href=&#34;https://github.com/vercel/next.js/&#34;  target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;noopener&#34;
